'''Giant''' (Japanese: '''巨漢''' ''Giant'') is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[DP050|Tag! We're It...!]]''.

Giant partook in the [[Hearthome City Tag Battle Competition]] where he was paired with an unnamed female competitor. Both of them were {{an|Dawn}}'s and [[Conway]]'s first opponents in the tournament. Using a combination of Dawn's attack from her {{TP|Dawn|Piplup}} and Conway's defense of his {{p|Slowking}}, Giant got defeated alongside his tag partner and he got eliminated from the tournament.
